    "title": "California Gov. Gavin Newsom orders state capitol flags to fly at half-staff in wake of birthday party shooting in Stockton - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By NBC News Dillon Fuhrman Manoah Tuiasosopo ,\n1 days ago SACRAMENTO, Calif. (NBC, KYMA) - Gov. Gavin Newsom (D-Calif.) ordered flags at the state capitol be flown at half-staff in the wake of Saturday's deadly shooting in Stockton, California. Gov. Newsom wrote on X Monday saying his \"heart is with the families of the victims and the entire Stockton community.\" Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 9",
